iv class="relative mt-4 md:mt-8" id="schritt-1"><div class="mb-1 mt-4 flex items-center justify-center md:mb-6 md:mt-8"><div class="h-px grow border-b-2 border-gray-300"></div><div class=""></div><div class="mx-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-medium"><span class="text-gray-800">Schritt</span><span class="bg-green-efk-200 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-white">1</span></div><div class=""></div><div class="h-px grow border-b-2 border-gray-300"></div></div><div class="mb-3 mt-2 md:mb-6"><div class="flex flex-col"><img src="https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/1946_1460/public/2022-10/2022_filettopf_step1.jpg?h=6eb229a4&amp;itok=GsdKWNb0" srcSet="https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/576_432/public/2022-10/2022_filettopf_step1.jpg?h=6eb229a4&amp;itok=MkFkq0kR 576w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/1152_864/public/2022-10/2022_filettopf_step1.jpg?h=6eb229a4&amp;itok=dDJ6Ivh3 1152w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/973_730/public/2022-10/2022_filettopf_step1.jpg?h=6eb229a4&amp;itok=RFUA62R5 973w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/1946_1460/public/2022-10/2022_filettopf_step1.jpg?h=6eb229a4&amp;itok=GsdKWNb0 1946w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/700_530/public/2022-10/2022_filettopf_step1.jpg?h=6eb229a4&amp;itok=OPI_wXQD 700w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/1400_1060/public/2022-10/2022_filettopf_step1.jpg?h=6eb229a4&amp;itok=-ESQMbGV 1400w" alt="Filettopf - Fleisch in 2-3 cm dicke Scheiben schneiden" title="Filettopf - Fleisch in 2-3 cm dicke Scheiben schneiden" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" class="w-full" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 700px"/><div class="uppercase text-[9px] font-medium text-gray-400 mt-1 text-right">Foto: <!-- -->Mark Kipson / EINFACH KOCHEN</div></div></div><div class="mb-4 mt-1 flex items-center md:mb-8 md:mt-6"><div class="bg-icon-step mr-3 h-8 w-8 min-w-[32px] max-w-[32px] bg-contain bg-center bg-no-repeat"></div><div class="flex flex-wrap"><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">600<!-- --> g</span><span class="ml-1">Schweinefilet</span></div></div></div><div class="mt-3 md:mt-6"><div class="html-text hyphens-auto [&amp;_li]:word-break-word [&amp;_h1]:font-brandon [&amp;_h1]:text-[46px] [&amp;_h1]:font-medium [&amp;_h1]:leading-[70px] [&amp;_h2]:font-brandon [&amp;_h2]:text-[24px] [&amp;_h2]:font-medium [&amp;_h2]:leading-[30px] [&amp;_h3]:text-[22px] [&amp;_h3]:font-medium [&amp;_h4]:text-[18px] [&amp;_h4]:font-medium text-xl"><p><span><span>Schweinefilets kalt abwaschen, trocken tupfen und ggf. von Sehnen und Fett befreien. Fleisch in <strong>2-3 cm dicke Scheiben</strong> schneiden.</span></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="stf-slot relative flex items-start justify-center bg-gray-100 pt-[24px] slot-recipeBetweenSteps my-3 md:my-6"><div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1 z-10 -translate-x-1/2 transform text-center text-xs uppercase text-gray-500">Anzeige</div><div id="_R_chp6qminpfiuodb_" class="[&amp;&gt;div]:m-0! relative flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-start min-h-[400px] md:min-h-[250px] [&amp;&gt;div]:sticky [&amp;&gt;div]:top-[124px] md:[&amp;&gt;div]:top-0"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 96 44" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="Einfach Kochen Logo" class="w-[96px] h-[75px]"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_2059_28810)"><path d="M23.6523 8.06501C23.6523 7.89096 23.7935 7.71918 23.9873 7.69821L31.2865 6.90734C31.4804 6.88636 31.6215 7.02809 31.6215 7.20214V9.10136C31.6215 9.2754 31.4804 9.44775 31.2865 9.46873L26.4028 9.99767V12.1582L30.4221 11.7228C30.5982 11.7036 30.7571 11.8436 30.7571 12.0176V13.9169C30.7571 14.1085 30.5988 14.265 30.4221 14.2837L26.4028 14.7191V17.0707L31.2865 16.5417C31.4804 16.5208 31.6215 1