4163 15.1795 34.1889 15.3102 33.9984C15.316 33.9899 15.3194 33.9809 15.3257 33.9729C15.4204 33.8442 15.5471 33.7479 15.6905 33.6844C15.764 33.6521 15.8402 33.6254 15.9223 33.6124L16.5762 33.5103L16.7431 33.4842L17.2944 33.3981L17.5938 33.351L19.8349 33.0012C19.8808 32.9944 19.9261 32.991 19.9708 32.991C20.4102 32.9938 20.7968 33.3102 20.8674 33.753L20.9213 34.0926C20.9592 34.3307 20.9012 34.5693 20.7578 34.7649L20.7584 34.7644ZM21.593 30.6394C21.379 30.9302 21.063 31.1218 20.7033 31.1774L18.9773 31.4461C19.1362 30.9064 19.1706 30.3236 19.092 29.7714C19.0657 29.5855 19.0232 29.3077 18.971 28.9715L20.6299 28.7385C20.6987 28.7288 20.7676 28.7277 20.8347 28.7311C21.328 28.7646 21.7565 29.1365 21.8362 29.6359C21.893 29.9914 21.8064 30.3474 21.5918 30.6383L21.593 30.6394Z" fill="#ccc"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_2059_28810"><rect width="96" height="44" fill="white"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></div></div><div class="paragraph--ParagraphRecipeStep md:mt-4 mt-0"><div class="relative mt-4 md:mt-8" id="schritt-4"><div class="mb-1 mt-4 flex items-center justify-center md:mb-6 md:mt-8"><div class="h-px grow border-b-2 border-gray-300"></div><div class=""></div><div class="mx-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-medium"><span class="text-gray-800">Schritt</span><span class="bg-green-efk-200 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-white">4</span></div><div class=""></div><div class="h-px grow border-b-2 border-gray-300"></div></div><div class="mb-3 mt-2 md:mb-6"><div class="flex flex-col"><img src="https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/1946_1460/public/2022-10/2022_filettopf_step2.jpg?h=6eb229a4&amp;itok=mIiDa4EW" srcSet="https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/576_432/public/2022-10/2022_filettopf_step2.jpg?h=6eb229a4&amp;itok=Eijvwx6A 576w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/1152_864/public/2022-10/2022_filettopf_step2.jpg?h=6eb229a4&amp;itok=jMlIh2Kq 1152w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/973_730/public/2022-10/2022_filettopf_step2.jpg?h=6eb229a4&amp;itok=dNX5jaom 973w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/1946_1460/public/2022-10/2022_filettopf_step2.jpg?h=6eb229a4&amp;itok=mIiDa4EW 1946w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/700_530/public/2022-10/2022_filettopf_step2.jpg?h=6eb229a4&amp;itok=qoo33QSx 700w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/1400_1060/public/2022-10/2022_filettopf_step2.jpg?h=6eb229a4&amp;itok=dgKYkXJu 1400w" alt="Filettopf - Champignons mit Zwiebel, Knoblauch, Schinkenwürfeln, Tomatenmark und Senf anschwitzen" title="Filettopf - Champignons mit Zwiebel, Knoblauch, Schinkenwürfeln, Tomatenmark und Senf anschwitzen" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" class="w-full" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 700px"/><div class="uppercase text-[9px] font-medium text-gray-400 mt-1 text-right">Foto: <!-- -->Mark Kipson  / EINFACH KOCHEN</div></div></div><div class="mb-4 mt-1 flex items-center md:mb-8 md:mt-6"><div class="bg-icon-step mr-3 h-8 w-8 min-w-[32px] max-w-[32px] bg-contain bg-center bg-no-repeat"></div><div class="flex flex-wrap"><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">20<!-- --> g</span><span class="ml-1">Butter</span><span>,</span></div><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">80<!-- --> g</span><span class="ml-1">Schinkenwürfel</span><span> <!-- -->(z.B. Katenschinken)</span><span>,</span></div><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">1<!-- --> TL</span><span class="ml-1">Tomatenmark</span><span> <!-- -->(2-fach konzentriert)</span><span>,</span></div><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">2<!-- --> TL</span><span class="ml-1">mittelscharfer <!-- -->Senf</span><span>,</span></div><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">400<!-- --> ml</span><span class="ml-1">Gemüsebrühe</span></div></div></div><div class="mt-3 md:mt-6"><div class="html-text hyphens-auto [&amp;_li]:word-break-word [&amp;_h1]:font-brandon [&amp;_h1]:text-[46px] [&amp;_h1]:font-medium [&amp;_h1]:leading-[70px] [&amp;_h2]:font-brandon [&amp;_h2]:text-[24px] [&amp;_h2]:font-medium [&amp;_h2]:leading-[30px] [&amp;_h3]:text-[22px] [&amp;_h3]:font-medium [&amp;_h4]:text-[18px] [&amp;_h4]:font-medium text-xl"><p><span><span>Butter in der Pfanne zerlassen, Champignons, Zwiebel- und Knoblauchwürfel zugeben und <strong><span data-type="timer" data-min-time="2" data-max-time="3"><span data-type="timer" data-min-time="2" data-max-time="3">2-3 Minuten</span></span></strong> hellbraun anschwitzen. Schinkenwürfel, Tomatenmark und Senf zugeben und </span></span><strong><span><span>1 Minute</span></span></strong><span><span> anschwitzen. M<span>it Gemüsebrühe ablöschen, Bratensatz lösen und <strong><span data-type="timer" data-min-time="1" data-max-time="2"><span data-type="timer" data-min-time="1" data-max-time="2">1-2 Minuten</span></span> </strong>unter Rühren köcheln lassen.</span></span></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="paragraph--ParagraphRecipeStep md:mt-4 mt-0"><div class="relative mt-4 md:mt-8" id="schritt-5"><div class="mb-1 mt-4 flex items-center justify-center md:mb-6 md:mt-8"><div class="h-px grow border-b-2 border-gray-300"></div><div class=""></div><div class="mx-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-medium"><span class="text-gray-800">Schritt</span><span class="bg-green-efk-200 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-white">5</span></div><div class=""></div><div class="h-px grow border-b-2 border-gray-300"></div></div><div class="mb-4 mt-1 flex items-center md:mb-8 md:mt-6"><div class="bg-icon-step mr-3 h-8 w-8 min-w-[32px] max-w-[32px] bg-contain bg-center bg-no-repeat"></div><div class="flex flex-wrap"><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">1<!-- --> TL</span><span class="ml-1">Speisestärke</span><span>,</span></div><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">1<!-- --> EL</span><span class="ml-1">Wasser</span><span>,</span></div><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">200<!-- --> ml</span><span class="ml-1">Sahne</span><span> <!-- -->(30 % Fett)</span></div></div></div><div class="mt-3 md:mt-6"><div class="html-text hyphens-auto [&amp;_li]:word-break-word [&amp;_h1]:font-brandon [&amp;_h1]:text-[46px] [&amp;_h1]:font-medium [&amp;_h1]:leading-[70px] [&amp;_h2]:font-brandon [&amp;_h2]:text-[24px] [&amp;_h2]:font-medium [&amp;_h2]:leading-[30px] [&amp;_h3]:text-[22px] [&amp;_h3]:font-medium [&amp;_h4]:text-[18px] [&amp;_h4]:font-medium text-xl"><p><span><span><span>Speisestärke mit 1 EL Wasser glattrühren. Schweinefilet mit Bratensaft in die Pfanne geben. Mit Sahne auffüllen und <strong>ca. <span data-type="timer" data-min-time="2" data-max-time="2"><span data-type="timer" data-min-time="2" data-max-time="2">2 Minuten</span></span></strong> köcheln lassen. Angerührte Stärke hinzufügen. </span></span></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="paragraph--ParagraphRecipeStep md:mt-4 mt-0"><div class="relative mt-4 md:mt-8" id="schritt-6"><div class="mb-1 mt-4 flex items-center justify-center md:mb-6 md:mt-8"><div class="h-px grow border-b-2 border-gray-300"></div><div class=""></div><div class="mx-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-medium"><span class="text-gray-800">Schritt</span><span class="bg-green-efk-200 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-white">6</span></div><div class=""></div><div class="h-px grow border-b-2 border-gray-300"></div></div><div class="mb-4 mt-1 flex items-center md:mb-8 md:mt-6"><div class="bg-icon-step mr-3 h-8 w-8 min-w-[32px] max-w-[32px] bg-contain bg-center bg-no-repeat"></div><div class="flex flex-wrap"><div class="mr-2 inline-block text-lg leading-8"><span class="font-semibold">150<!-- --> g</span><span class="ml-1">Crème fraîche</span><span> <!-- -->(30 % Fett)</span></div></div></div><div class="mt-3 md:mt-6"><div class="html-text hyphens-auto [&amp;_li]:word-break-word [&amp;_h1]:font-brandon [&amp;_h1]:text-[46px] [&amp;_h1]:font-medium [&amp;_h1]:leading-[70px] [&amp;_h2]:font-brandon [&amp;_h2]:text-[24px] [&amp;_h2]:font-medium [&amp;_h2]:leading-[30px] [&amp;_h3]:text-[22px] [&amp;_h3]:font-medium [&amp;_h4]:text-[18px] [&amp;_h4]:font-medium text-xl"><p><span><span><span>Crème fraîche einrühren und mit Salz und Pfeffer abschmecken. Filettopf auf 4 Teller verteilen, mit gehackter Petersilie bestreuen und nach Wunsch mit Bandnudeln servieren. <strong>Guten Appetit!</strong></span></span></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="paragraph--ParagraphTipBox md:mt-4 mt-0"><div class="mt-10 md:mt-12 mb-4 md:mb-12"><div class="relative border-yellow-efk border"><div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 z-10 -translate-x-1/2 md:-top-5"><div class="bg-green-efk-200 inline-block px-6 py-1 text-base font-medium text-white md:px-10 md:py-2 md:text-xl">Mein Tipp</div></div><div class="p-6 pt-4"><div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-4 md:mt-9 md:flex-row"><div class="flex-1 md:order-1"><div class="font-brandon mb-2 text-[21px] font-medium md:text-2xl">Filettopf mit Champignons im Backofen</div><div class="html-text hyphens-auto [&amp;_li]:word-break-word [&amp;_h1]:font-brandon [&amp;_h1]:text-[46px] [&amp;_h1]:font-medium [&amp;_h1]:leading-[70px] [&amp;_h2]:font-brandon [&amp;_h2]:text-[24px] [&amp;_h2]:font-medium [&amp;_h2]:leading-[30px] [&amp;_h3]:text-[22px] [&amp;_h3]:font-medium [&amp;_h4]:text-[18px] [&amp;_h4]:font-medium font-brandon mb-2 text-[18px] font-normal md:text-xl"><p><span><span>Lege die angebratenen Filetstücke in eine Auflaufform, begieße sie mit der fertigen Soße und gare deinen Filettopf am nächsten Tag im vorgeheizten Backofen bei 140 Grad Umluft <strong>ca. 25 Minuten.</strong></span></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="paragraph--ParagraphEditorsRecommendation md:mt-4 mt-0"><div class="relative mb-0 mt-8 md:mt-24"><div class="bg-green-efk-200 absolute -top-4 left-1/2 z-10 inline-block -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-1 text-lg font-medium text-white md:static md:translate-x-0">Mein Redaktionstipp</div><div class="flex flex-wrap md:flex-nowrap shadow-section bg-white"><div class="w-full md:w-[57%]"><a target="_self" rel="follow" href="/rezepte/parboiled-reis-kochen"><div class="flex flex-col"><img src="https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/1536_1152/public/2021-07/parboiled_reis_1_0.jpg?h=4521fff0&amp;itok=W4J5IJyZ" srcSet="https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/576_432/public/2021-07/parboiled_reis_1_0.jpg?h=4521fff0&amp;itok=xVLyflK5 576w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/1152_864/public/2021-07/parboiled_reis_1_0.jpg?h=4521fff0&amp;itok=TCI1OCqN 1152w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/768_576/public/2021-07/parboiled_reis_1_0.jpg?h=4521fff0&amp;itok=63-RlUSY 768w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/1536_1152/public/2021-07/parboiled_reis_1_0.jpg?h=4521fff0&amp;itok=W4J5IJyZ 1536w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/350_265/public/2021-07/parboiled_reis_1_0.jpg?h=4521fff0&amp;itok=PIfsC-YF 350w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/700_530/public/2021-07/parboiled_reis_1_0.jpg?h=4521fff0&amp;itok=bufgnBc1 700w" alt="Parboiled Reis kochen" title="Parboiled Reis kochen" width="2048" height="1536" loading="lazy" class="h-auto w-full" sizes="(max-width: 576px) 576px, (max-width: 768px) 768px, 800px"/><div class="text-right mb-0.5 mr-2 mt-0.5 text-[12px] font-normal normal-case text-gray-400 md:mr-0">Foto: <!-- -->Maria Panzer / EINFACH KOCHEN</div></div></a></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col px-6 pb-4 pt-2 md:p-6"><a target="_s