div><div class="flex items-center font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="15" fill="currentColor" class="mr-1 h-4 w-4 text-gray-400"><path d="M8.424.727H4.303v1.316h4.121V.727zM5.677 9.281H7.05V5.333H5.677v3.948zm5.515-4.35.976-.933a7.438 7.438 0 0 0-.969-.928l-.975.934a6.325 6.325 0 0 0-3.86-1.303C2.95 2.701.182 5.353.182 8.623c0 3.27 2.761 5.922 6.182 5.922 3.42 0 6.181-2.651 6.181-5.922a5.745 5.745 0 0 0-1.353-3.691zM6.364 13.23c-2.659 0-4.808-2.06-4.808-4.606s2.15-4.606 4.808-4.606 4.808 2.06 4.808 4.606c0 2.547-2.15 4.606-4.808 4.606z"></path></svg>20 Min.</div><div class="mx-1 h-4 w-px bg-gray-200 md:mx-2"></div><div class="flex items-center font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-no-axes-column-increasing mr-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-gray-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 21v-6"></path><path d="M12 21V9"></path><path d="M19 21V3"></path></svg><span class="whitespace-nowrap">Einfach</span></div></div><div class="md:w-auto"><a target="_self" rel="follow" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-yellow-efk text-white hover:bg-yellow-efk/90 py-2 font-semibold px-8 text-md" href="/rezepte/parboiled-reis-kochen">Zum Rezept</a></div></div><div class="relative mb-6 p-4 border-b-2 border-t-2 border-[#d6dfe1]"><div class="html-text hyphens-auto text-base italic">»<!-- -->Neben Nudeln ist auch Reis eine leckere Beilage zu unserem Filettopf. Wie er perfekt gelingt, erfährst du hier!<!-- -->«</div><div class="bg-fin absolute -bottom-4 left-4 bg-contain bg-no-repeat h-4 w-5"></div></div><a target="_self" rel="follow" class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 transition-opacity hover:opacity-80" href="/autoren/catherina-faas"><div class="flex flex-col shrink-0"><img src="https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/author_thumbnail_2x/public/2022-07/Catherina_5031%20Kopie%202_3.jpg?itok=7QFtH2rJ" srcSet="https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/author_thumbnail/public/2022-07/Catherina_5031%20Kopie%202_3.jpg?itok=Pf4oDHv_ 50w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/author_thumbnail_2x/public/2022-07/Catherina_5031%20Kopie%202_3.jpg?itok=7QFtH2rJ 100w" alt="Food-Redakteurin Catherina" title="Food-Redakteurin Catherina" width="1231" height="1016" loading="lazy" class="size-12 overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 border-[#d6dfe1]" sizes="100vw"/></div><div class="hyphens-auto text-base font-semibold text-gray-700">Catherina<!-- -->, <br/>Food-Redakteurin</div></a></div></div></div></div><div></div><div class="my-6"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="h-px flex-1 bg-gray-300"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4"><h3 class="font-brandon text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900">Ernährungsinfo</h3><div class="bg-green-efk-200 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-lg font-bold text-white">i</div></div><div class="h-px flex-1 bg-gray-300"></div></div><div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-5 sm:gap-4"><div class="px-2"><div class="text-sm md:text-base">Energie in kcal</div><div class="text-sm font-bold md:text-base">591<!-- --> <!-- -->/ Portion</div></div><div class="px-2"><div class="text-sm md:text-base">Energie in kJ</div><div class="text-sm font-bold md:text-base">2475<!-- --> <!-- -->/ Portion</div></div><div class="px-2"><div class="text-sm md:text-base">Kohlenhydrate</div><div class="text-sm font-bold md:text-base">7.5g<!-- --> <!-- -->/ Portion</div></div><div class="px-2"><div class="text-sm md:text-base">Eiweiß</div><div class="text-sm font-bold md:text-base">44.7g<!-- --> <!-- -->/ Portion</div></div><div class="px-2"><div class="text-sm md:text-base">Fett</div><div class="text-sm font-bold md:text-base">42.8g<!-- --> <!-- -->/ Portion</div></div></div></div></div></div><aside class="hidden space-y-4 lg:block lg:w-80 lg:space-y-6"><div><div class="space-y-4"><hr class="border-gray-light h-[2px] w-full border-0 border-b-2 bg-transparent"/><div class="w-full space-y-2 md:space-y-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between py-1"><span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[18px] font-bold">Gesamtzeit</span><span class="text-[18px] font-bold">40 Min.</span></div><hr class="border-gray-light h-[2px] w-full border-0 border-b-2 bg-transparent"/><div class="space-y-2 text-[18px] md:space-y-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>Vorbereitung</span><span class="font-bold">20 Min.</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>Zubereitung</span><span class="font-bold">20 Min.</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>Niveau</span><span class="font-bold">Mittel</span></div></div></div><hr class="border-gray-light h-[2px] w-full border-0 border-b-2 bg-transparent"/><div class="space-y-6"><p class="text-lg leading-7">Sooo cremig: Unser Rezept für würzigen Filettopf mit Champignons ist nicht nur unkompliziert, sondern lässt sich auch super vorbereiten! Jetzt reinklicken und genießen!</p><a target="_self" rel="follow" class="flex items-center gap-4 transition-opacity hover:opacity-80" href="/autoren/mark-kipson"><div class="size-[48px] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 border-gray-200"><div class="flex flex-col"><img src="https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/author_thumbnail_2x/public/2022-08/mark_1_1.jpg?itok=o5jtwa9w" srcSet="https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/author_thumbnail/public/2022-08/mark_1_1.jpg?itok=XdP7jCLY 50w, https://www.einfachkochen.de/sites/einfachkochen.de/files/styles/author_thumbnail_2x/public/2022-08/mark_1_1.jp